 			<p>“I always call you so to myself⁠—I forgot; but I won’t, unless you like it.”</p>
 			<p>“Like it? it is more sweet to me than I can tell. Say ‘thou,’ also, and I shall say your language is almost as beautiful as mine.”</p>
